{"watch":29,"start":8400,"events":[{"seq":1604,"t":8400,"type":"watch","watch":29},{"seq":1605,"t":8400,"type":"decode","house":"orchid","letter":"L412","text":"_OWMEN, HOLD _T WE_T FO_D.","readable":true},{"seq":1606,"t":8400,"type":"decode","house":"tiger","letter":"L502","text":"WE WILL HOLD F1. DO NOT ADVANCE FURTHER SOUTH.","readable":true},{"seq":1607,"t":8400,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1923,"retries":0},{"seq":1608,"t":8400,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"It is Watch 29/30. I need to secure two fords or take a camp standard. My forces are spread thin. The kite and tiger have presence near F1/NW. I must exploit the known enemy locations and secure F1/F2. Rhino inf-1 is at F1. I will reinforce F1 and push towards F2, while using cav"},{"seq":1609,"t":8400,"type":"courier","id":"c471","house":"rhino","letter":"L577","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-2","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":8400,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":1610,"t":8400,"type":"courier","id":"c472","house":"rhino","letter":"L578","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west"],"depart":8400,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":1611,"t":8400,"type":"courier","id":"c473","house":"rhino","letter":"L579","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1"],"depart":8400,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1612,"t":8400,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1956,"retries":0},{"seq":1613,"t":8400,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It's Watch 29. Orchid has a truce. My doctrine suggests making a friend. I should try to leverage this or attack the weakest link. Rhino seems active at F1/West Ford. I'll move my forces to challenge Rhino's presence, aiming to secure a ford or capture a camp standard if possible"},{"seq":1614,"t":8400,"type":"courier","id":"c474","house":"kite","letter":"L580","kind":"order","to":